    {
      "source": "Parser to populate the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ClassPathScanningCandidateComponentProvider.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ClassPathScanningCandidateComponentProvider</code></a> with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/type/filter/TypeFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.type.filter\"><code>TypeFilter</code></a>s parsed from\nthe given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>'s children.",
