    {
      "source": "Returns all <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/type/filter/TypeFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.type.filter\"><code>TypeFilter</code></a> declared in nested elements of the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>. Allows to selectively\nretrieve including or excluding filters based on the given <a href=\"TypeFilterParser.Type.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.config\"><code>TypeFilterParser.Type</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>的嵌套元素中声明的所有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/type/filter/TypeFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.type.filter\"><code>TypeFilter</code></a>。允许根据给定的<a href=\"TypeFilterParser.Type.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.config\"><code>TypeFilterParser.Type</code></a>选择性地检索包含或排除过滤器。",
